{
  "schema_version": "solar.workflow_contract.v1",
  "workflow_id": "research.deepdive.rsi_demo",
  "version": "1.3",
  "title": "RSI DeepDive Report",
  "dag_variant": "research",
  "trigger": {
    "explicit_markers": [
      "deepdive",
      "deep dive",
      "deepresearch",
      "deep research",
      "深度研究",
      "深研",
      "深度调研报告"
    ],
    "env_gates": [
      {
        "env": "SOLAR_DEMO_REPORT_MODE",
        "equals": "1"
      }
    ],
    "requirement_compiler_type": "RESEARCH",
    "generic_words_insufficient": [
      "research",
      "研究",
      "调研"
    ],
    "on_match": "bypass should_epic_decompose_request and PM epic decomposition; instantiate this contract as the task graph (identity = workflow_contract_id; dag_variant stays in its closed enum)"
  },
  "provider_policy": {
    "runtime": "codex",
    "allowed_providers": [
      "openai"
    ],
    "route_proof_required": true,
    "route_records": "per_stage_execution_append_only"
  },
  "source_mode": {
    "network": false,
    "seed_pack": "demo-rsi/source-pack/"
  },
  "artifact_roots": {
    "canonical": "sprints/<sid>/workdir/rsi-deep-research-report/",
    "aliases": [
      "workspace/rsi-deep-research-report/"
    ],
    "publish_rule": "export stage copies canonical set to evidence/report/rsi-deep-research-report/"
  },
  "validator_command": "python3 scripts/validate_rsi_demo_report.py --workspace <resolved_root>",
  "release_proof_level": "P3",
  "dashboard": {
    "pipeline_strip": true
  },
  "forbidden": {
    "capsules": [
      "cap.requirement-compiler-implementation"
    ],
    "proof_obligations": [
      "patch_diff",
      "patch_within_scope",
      "resource_binding.workspace_root"
    ]
  },
  "stages": [
    {
      "id": "D1",
      "gate_family": "DD_SCOPE",
      "node_kind": "analysis",
      "logical_operator": "DeepDiveBriefCapture",
      "depends_on": [],
      "task_type": "audit_inventory",
      "allowed_capsules": [
        "cap.requirement-compiler-audit"
      ],
      "allowed_operators": {
        "role": "builder",
        "providers": [
          "openai"
        ]
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "path": "scope-contract.json",
          "type": "json"
        }
      ],
      "proof_obligations": [
        {
          "kind": "postcondition",
          "requirement": "output_present",
          "field": "scope-contract.json",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        }
      ],
      "evaluator_gate": {
        "kind": "none"
      },
      "dashboard_label": "D1 · Scope",
      "timeouts": {
        "result_timeout_sec": 900,
        "on_timeout_classification": "ORCHESTRATION_WEDGE_NOT_PRODUCT_PROOF"
      },
      "goal": "Freeze the demo scope. Read the seed source pack shipped at demo-rsi/source-pack/ under the harness root (sources.json + source-notes/*.md) — it is the ENTIRE corpus; do not fetch the web. Write scope-contract.json to the canonical artifact root declaring: the bounded research question (what recursive self-improvement is, what limits it, and what the pack's evidence shows), the D1-D6 stage plan, the in-scope seed-pack source ids, and the output contract (sources.json, claims.json, contradiction-matrix.json, report.md, report.html, evaluation-checklist.md)."
    },
    {
      "id": "D2",
      "gate_family": "DD_SOURCE",
      "node_kind": "artifact",
      "logical_operator": "DeepDiveSourceCollector",
      "depends_on": [
        "D1"
      ],
      "task_type": "knowledge-extraction",
      "allowed_capsules": [
        "cap.requirement-research-scout"
      ],
      "allowed_operators": {
        "role": "builder",
        "providers": [
          "openai"
        ]
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "path": "sources.json",
          "type": "json",
          "demo_artifact": true
        }
      ],
      "proof_obligations": [
        {
          "kind": "postcondition",
          "requirement": "output_present",
          "field": "sources.json",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        },
        {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "requirement": "min_sources",
          "value": 5,
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        },
        {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "requirement": "all_pack_sources_represented",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        }
      ],
      "evaluator_gate": {
        "kind": "deterministic_command",
        "command": "python3 scripts/validate_rsi_demo_report.py --workspace <resolved_root> --sources-only",
        "on_fail": "repair_once_then_fail"
      },
      "dashboard_label": "D2 · Sources",
      "timeouts": {
        "result_timeout_sec": 900
      },
      "goal": "Produce sources.json at the canonical artifact root from the seed pack at demo-rsi/source-pack/ under the harness root: one entry per pack source carrying id, title, authors, year, venue, citation_hint and topic_tags copied faithfully from the pack's sources.json and source-notes/*.md. Every pack source must be represented; do not invent sources; do not fetch the web. The deterministic gate audits the exported set for authority and profile gaps."
    },
    {
      "id": "D3",
      "gate_family": "DD_EVIDENCE",
      "node_kind": "artifact",
      "logical_operator": "DeepDiveClaimCompiler",
      "depends_on": [
        "D2"
      ],
      "task_type": "evidence",
      "allowed_capsules": [
        "cap.requirement-research-synthesizer",
        "cap.requirement-compiler-audit"
      ],
      "allowed_operators": {
        "role": "builder",
        "providers": [
          "openai"
        ]
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "path": "claims.json",
          "type": "json",
          "demo_artifact": true
        }
      ],
      "proof_obligations": [
        {
          "kind": "postcondition",
          "requirement": "output_present",
          "field": "claims.json",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        },
        {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "requirement": "min_claims",
          "value": 10,
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        },
        {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "requirement": "all_claim_source_ids_in_sources",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        }
      ],
      "evaluator_gate": {
        "kind": "deterministic_command",
        "command": "python3 scripts/validate_rsi_demo_report.py --workspace <resolved_root> --claims-only",
        "inputs_produced_by_this_gate": [
          "research_eval.json"
        ],
        "on_fail": "repair_once_then_fail",
        "on_capacity_unavailable": "wait",
        "on_human_review": "warn_and_continue",
        "verdict_kinds": [
          "content",
          "mechanical",
          "infrastructure"
        ]
      },
      "dashboard_label": "D3 · Claims",
      "timeouts": {
        "result_timeout_sec": 1200
      },
      "goal": "Compile claims.json at the canonical artifact root: at least 10 claims extracted from the seed pack source notes (demo-rsi/source-pack/source-notes/ under the harness root), each an object {claim_id, source_id, claim_text, claim_type, stance, confidence} where source_id is an id present in sources.json and claim_text quotes or faithfully paraphrases that source note. No claims from memory or the open web — every claim must be traceable to its note. The deterministic gate enforces counts, claim-to-source linkage and non-empty claim text."
    },
    {
      "id": "D4",
      "gate_family": "DD_EVIDENCE",
      "node_kind": "analysis",
      "logical_operator": "DeepDiveContradictionScanner",
      "depends_on": [
        "D3"
      ],
      "task_type": "evidence",
      "allowed_capsules": [
        "cap.requirement-research-synthesizer"
      ],
      "allowed_operators": {
        "role": "builder",
        "providers": [
          "openai"
        ]
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "path": "contradiction-matrix.json",
          "type": "json"
        }
      ],
      "proof_obligations": [
        {
          "kind": "postcondition",
          "requirement": "output_present",
          "field": "contradiction-matrix.json",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        }
      ],
      "evaluator_gate": {
        "kind": "none"
      },
      "dashboard_label": "D4 · Contradictions",
      "timeouts": {
        "result_timeout_sec": 900
      },
      "goal": "Write contradiction-matrix.json at the canonical artifact root: cross-source tensions, weak-evidence flags and open questions derived ONLY from claims.json — each entry must cite the claim_ids involved and state the nature of the tension (direct contradiction, scope mismatch, unsupported extrapolation, or evidence gap)."
    },
    {
      "id": "D5",
      "gate_family": "DD_SYNTHESIS",
      "node_kind": "artifact",
      "logical_operator": "DeepDiveChiefEditor",
      "depends_on": [
        "D3",
        "D4"
      ],
      "task_type": "reporting",
      "allowed_capsules": [
        "cap.requirement-compiler-audit"
      ],
      "allowed_operators": {
        "role": "builder",
        "providers": [
          "openai"
        ]
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "path": "report.md",
          "type": "markdown",
          "demo_artifact": true
        },
        {
          "path": "report.html",
          "type": "html",
          "demo_artifact": true
        }
      ],
      "proof_obligations": [
        {
          "kind": "postcondition",
          "requirement": "output_present",
          "field": "report.md",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        },
        {
          "kind": "postcondition",
          "requirement": "output_present",
          "field": "report.html",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        },
        {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "requirement": "html_present",
          "value": "<html",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        },
        {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "requirement": "no_stub_tokens",
          "token_list": "validate_rsi_demo_report.py PLACEHOLDER_TOKENS",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        }
      ],
      "evaluator_gate": {
        "kind": "llm_eval",
        "role": "evaluator",
        "on_capacity_unavailable": "wait",
        "on_human_review": "warn_and_continue",
        "verdict_kinds": [
          "content",
          "mechanical",
          "infrastructure"
        ]
      },
      "dashboard_label": "D5 · Report",
      "timeouts": {
        "result_timeout_sec": 1800
      },
      "goal": "Synthesize report.md and report.html at the canonical artifact root from claims.json and contradiction-matrix.json: an evidence-grounded report on the bounded RSI question with an inline [source_id] citation for every substantive statement, a contradictions/tensions section, and a limitations section. No placeholder or TODO text; report.html must be a complete standalone HTML document rendering the same content."
    },
    {
      "id": "D6",
      "gate_family": "DD_PUBLISH",
      "node_kind": "publish",
      "logical_operator": "DeepDiveArtifactPublisher",
      "depends_on": [
        "D5"
      ],
      "task_type": "documentation",
      "allowed_capsules": [
        "cap.requirement-compiler-audit"
      ],
      "allowed_operators": {
        "role": "builder",
        "providers": [
          "openai"
        ]
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "path": "evaluation-checklist.md",
          "type": "markdown",
          "demo_artifact": true
        }
      ],
      "proof_obligations": [
        {
          "kind": "postcondition",
          "requirement": "output_present",
          "field": "evaluation-checklist.md",
          "proof_kind": "artifact_presence"
        },
        {
          "kind": "gate",
          "requirement": "all_required_artifacts_present",
          "proof_kind": "gate"
        },
        {
          "kind": "gate",
          "requirement": "route_proof_ok",
          "proof_kind": "gate"
        },
        {
          "kind": "gate",
          "requirement": "validator_command_exit_0",
          "proof_kind": "gate"
        }
      ],
      "evaluator_gate": {
        "kind": "deterministic_command",
        "command": "python3 scripts/validate_rsi_demo_report.py --workspace <resolved_root>",
        "on_fail": "fail"
      },
      "dashboard_label": "D6 · Publish",
      "timeouts": {
        "result_timeout_sec": 600
      },
      "goal": "Write evaluation-checklist.md at the canonical artifact root summarizing, per stage, the gate outcome and the produced artifacts (with one-line provenance for each), then verify the canonical artifact set is complete and consistent. The deterministic validator enforces the full artifact contract and fails the stage on any gap."
    }
  ],
  "required_artifacts": [
    "report.html",
    "report.md",
    "sources.json",
    "claims.json",
    "evaluation-checklist.md"
  ],
  "note": "Compressed D1-D6 form of the original D1-D9 (rsi-deepdive-workflow-lock.md has both and the mapping). on_human_review=warn_and_continue is DEMO-ONLY (unattended run); general research contracts use block_dependents with bounded human-wait per review disposition 8.1. Deltas from workflow-contract-schema.example.json so every stage compiles against the shipped capsule registry (R2a is checked against contract.preconditions task_type_in, no aliasing at the gate): D1 drops cap.requirement-research-scout (it does not admit audit_inventory); D2 task_type is knowledge-extraction (the scout capsule's admitted type; it was audit_inventory in the example); D5 drops cap.requirement-research-synthesizer (it does not admit reporting) and keeps cap.requirement-compiler-audit — the capsule/task_type mapping that went green live in v8/v9 (fe2a7d69, corpus F-049)."
}
